/v1/","context":{"app_id":4986360,"app_scope":"base","country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100,"review_scope":"store_summary_filtered","percentage_precision":"source_rounded_integer","review_score_label":"사용자 평가 없음"},"error_code":"no_reviews"}],"events":[{"id":"steam-steam-4986360-1847286114029878","game_id":"steam-4986360","kind":"announcement","title":"First time game launching in Polish fix + some changes","summary":"Upon the first launch, the game is intended to be in English. Unfortunately, it was starting up in Polish, which posed a significant issue for anyone unfamiliar with the language. I have fixed this and, while I was at it, made a few minor adjustments. Everything should now work without any problems.CHANGELOG:1. The language for the initial game launch has been set to English.2. I’ve made some slight changes to the furniture available in the demo.3. You can now cross to the other side of the stre","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-21T18:05:45Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114029878","verified_at":"2026-10-21T19:51:03Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4986360-1844751498221373","game_id":"steam-4986360","kind":"announcement","title":"Devlog 24.09 - furniture categories","summary":"Hello! I've been working on adding new products and furniture types. It will be much easier to find something you're looking for. Oh, ignore cereal category. It's just a test :) w","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-24T12:45:42Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844751498221373","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:55:54Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4986360-1844115010487831","game_id":"steam-4986360","kind":"announcement","title":"New demo is here!","summary":"After nearly a month of work, the new demo is ready. It features Polish language support, an improved city, customer preferences, and a new tutorial system. Unfortunately, due to issues with the plugin handling advanced dialogue, I had to cut those features. It’s not a major loss, though, as there were only a few of them. Have fun!","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-16T00:58:37Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844115010487831","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:55:54Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4986360-1841579228678061","game_id":"steam-4986360","kind":"announcement","title":"New demo is coming!","summary":"The new demo is on the way. It will be based on the new, updated version of the template (2.0x instead of 1.9x). New features: Polish language, Polish currency and some changes like customer preferences. Can't wait to upload it! Lighting and post processing is turned off in the editor.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-25T11:36:35Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1841579228678061","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:55:54Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4986360-1840944183785914","game_id":"steam-4986360","kind":"announcement","title":"Game braking bug in DEMO","summary":"Save system is broken... Hello! Unfortunately, one of the updates broke the save system in the demo version. I sincerely apologize for this and want to let you know that I'm working on a solution. I've identified several potential causes and will be investigating them one by one. Fixing this bug is my top priority right now. Again, I apologize.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-17T12:30:06Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840944183785914","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:55:54Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4986360-1840944183782782","game_id":"steam-4986360","kind":"update","title":"Demo update","summary":"I've fixed some serious bugs like no cashier spawning and added graphics options. It's still in beta but I'm learning how to improve it.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-15T19:35:35Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840944183782782","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:55:54Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4986360":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T05:55:24Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T05:55:23Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4986360":"2026-10-26T05:55:24Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4986360":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T05:55:23Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T05:55:23Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]},"5081890":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T05:55:24Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T05:55:24Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-4986360","app_id":4986360,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:15:14Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_success":1,"raw_item_sha256":"b587fb9e9f03d7f478396f3b1d1648397c6c4b0997e393880ecc2d7310a8a0de","response_sha256":null,"source_fields":{"basic_info":{"short_description":"Untitled Shop Game is a shop simulator that lets you unleash your artistic side. There are 200+ decorations and no limits to how, what, or where you place items (well, except for placing stuff on the roads). Oh, and one more thing: the game inclu